Agents mark sections of long replies with dash-underlined titles,
which nothing can fold. Pat's notmuch folds sections under org-style
"*" headings, so asking for that form lets him skim a long reply
and open only the part he needs. Lists move to "-" because a "* "
line at the margin would fold as a heading.
